{"code":"27-4032.00","title":"Film and Video Editors","description":"Edit moving images on film, video, or other media. May work with a producer or director to organize images for final production. May edit or synchronize soundtracks with images.","jobZone":4,"kinds":{"R":{"score":3.14,"share":0.1591},"I":{"score":1.91,"share":0.0677},"A":{"score":5.61,"share":0.3428},"S":{"score":1.96,"share":0.0714},"E":{"score":3.08,"share":0.1546},"C":{"score":3.75,"share":0.2045}},"highPoints":["A","C"],"tasks":[{"id":4057,"text":"Organize and string together raw footage into a continuous whole according to scripts or the instructions of directors and producers.","core":true,"importance":4.66,"relevance":94.64,"frequency":5.91},{"id":4052,"text":"Edit films and videotapes to insert music, dialogue, and sound effects, to arrange films into sequences, and to correct errors, using editing equipment.","core":true,"importance":4.6,"relevance":73.57,"frequency":5.92},{"id":4053,"text":"Select and combine the most effective shots of each scene to form a logical and smoothly running story.","core":true,"importance":4.58,"relevance":87.04,"frequency":5.98},{"id":4060,"text":"Review footage sequence by sequence to become familiar with it before assembling it into a final product.","core":true,"importance":4.55,"relevance":100,"frequency":5.79},{"id":4061,"text":"Set up and operate computer editing systems, electronic titling systems, video switching equipment, and digital video effects units to produce a final product.","core":true,"importance":4.53,"relevance":87.77,"frequency":5.73},{"id":4066,"text":"Trim film segments to specified lengths and reassemble segments in sequences that present stories with maximum effect.","core":true,"importance":4.39,"relevance":72.2,"frequency":5.42},{"id":4050,"text":"Cut shot sequences to different angles at specific points in scenes, making each individual cut as fluid and seamless as possible.","core":true,"importance":4.37,"relevance":82.44,"freque